      },
      "text": "Section 1. Section 4 of Executive Order 12293 of February 23, 1981, as \namended, is amended to read as follows: \n‘‘Sec. 4. Pursuant to section 402 of the Foreign Service Act (22 U.S.C. \n3962), and subject to any restrictions therein, there are established the fol-\nlowing salary classes with titles for the Senior Foreign Service, at the fol-\nlowing ranges of basic rates of pay:"
    },
    {
      "char_end": 1631,
      "char_start": 1430,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:13374#sec1-a",
      "kind": "subsection",
      "label": "(a)",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:13374#sec1-a",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "70 FR 12961, PDF pages 1-2",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "c12c5ad25c91e7457f25ce0c3af271c8c413b40d59ca643126c6a4ce563929a9",
        "signing_date": "2005-03-14",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_13374.txt",
        "text_sha256": "e215b3b29030ce81e03f4c3020282357796fdcdf660b457058a9ca8a541017c0",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2005-03-17/pdf/05-5434.pdf"
      },
      "text": "(a) Career Minister \nRange from 100 percent of the minimum rate of basic pay for sen-\nior-level positions under 5 U.S.C. 5376 to 100 percent of the rate \npayable for level II of the Executive Schedule."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 1838,
      "char_start": 1633,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:13374#sec1-b",
      "kind": "subsection",
      "label": "(b)",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:13374#sec1-b",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "70 FR 12961, PDF pages 1-2",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "c12c5ad25c91e7457f25ce0c3af271c8c413b40d59ca643126c6a4ce563929a9",
        "signing_date": "2005-03-14",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_13374.txt",
        "text_sha256": "e215b3b29030ce81e03f4c3020282357796fdcdf660b457058a9ca8a541017c0",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2005-03-17/pdf/05-5434.pdf"
      },
      "text": "(b) Minister-Counselor \nRange from 100 percent of the minimum rate of basic pay for sen-\nior-level positions under 5 U.S.C. 5376 to 107 percent of the rate \npayable for level III of the Executive Schedule."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2038,
      "char_start": 1840,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:13374#sec1-c",
      "kind": "subsection",
      "label": "(c)",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:13374#sec1-c",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "70 FR 12961, PDF pages 1-2",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "c12c5ad25c91e7457f25ce0c3af271c8c413b40d59ca643126c6a4ce563929a9",
        "signing_date": "2005-03-14",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_13374.txt",
        "text_sha256": "e215b3b29030ce81e03f4c3020282357796fdcdf660b457058a9ca8a541017c0",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2005-03-17/pdf/05-5434.pdf"
      },
      "text": "(c) Counselor \nRange from 100 percent of the minimum rate of basic pay for sen-\nior-level positions under 5 U.S.C. 5376 to 102 percent of the rate \npayable for level III of the Executive Schedule.’’"
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2372,
      "char_start": 2039,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:13374#sec2",
      "kind": "amendment_instruction",
      "label": "Sec. 2.",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:13374#sec2",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "70 FR 12961, PDF pages 1-2",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "c12c5ad25c91e7457f25ce0c3af271c8c413b40d59ca643126c6a4ce563929a9",
        "signing_date": "2005-03-14",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_13374.txt",
        "text_sha256": "e215b3b29030ce81e03f4c3020282357796fdcdf660b457058a9ca8a541017c0",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2005-03-17/pdf/05-5434.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 2. Section 2 of Executive Order 12293, as amended, is amended by \nstriking ‘‘the Director of the International Communication Agency, the Direc-\ntor of the United States International Development Cooperation Agency’’ \nand inserting in lieu thereof ‘‘the Administrator of the United States Agency \nfor International Development’’."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2436,
      "char_start": 2374,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:13374#sec3",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 3.",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:13374#sec3",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "70 FR 12961, PDF pages 1-2",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "c12c5ad25c91e7457f25ce0c3af271c8c413b40d59ca643126c6a4ce563929a9",
        "signing_date": "2005-03-14",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_13374.txt",
        "text_sha256": "e215b3b29030ce81e03f4c3020282357796fdcdf660b457058a9ca8a541017c0",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2005-03-17/pdf/05-5434.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 3. Executive Order 13325 of January 23, 2004, is revoked."
    },
