        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2005-03-17/pdf/05-5434.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 4. This order is not intended to, and does not, create any right or \nbenefit, substantive or procedural, enforceable by any party at law or in \nVerDate jul<14>2003 07:41 Mar 16, 2005 Jkt 205001 PO 00000 Frm 00001 Fmt 4705 Sfmt 4790 E:\\FR\\FM\\17MRE0.SGM 17MRE0\n=== PDF page 2 of 2 ===\n12962 Federal Register / Vol. 70, No. 51 / Thursday, March 17, 2005 / Presidential Documents \nequity against the United States, its departments, agencies, entities, officers, \nemployees, or agents, or any other person.\nW"
    }
  ],
